From bf7f3006a4ae569660304263321654003b44bd3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MT6789 Clk Agent <agent@local>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:11:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] clk: mediatek: Add MT6789 infracfg_ao clock driver

Register the 62 MT6789 infracfg_ao gates across the six
set/clr/sta banks (0x80/0x88/0xa4/0xc0/0xe0/0xd0) using GATE_MTK
macros and mtk_clk_simple_probe, following the mt8186 infra_ao
structure. Gate names and gate bits are kept from the vendor
tables; parent names are renamed to the topckgen outputs
(top_axi, top_uart, top_msdc50_0, f26m, ...) per the mainline
naming convention.

Change-Id: Ic2cf146b03963d6b9908a054cd0921a41d825d67
Signed-off-by: MT6789 Clk Agent <agent@local>
---
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-infra_ao.c | 166 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 166 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-infra_ao.c

diff --git a/drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-infra_ao.c b/drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-infra_ao.c
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..269e47b96
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-infra_ao.c
@@ -0,0 +1,166 @@
